{'symbol': 'PFE', 'date': '2022-11-03 09:10:00', 'title': "PFIZER'S ELRANATAMAB GRANTED FDA BREAKTHROUGH THERAPY DESIGNATION FOR RELAPSED OR REFRACTORY MULTIPLE MYELOMA", 'text': 'NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--PFIZER INC. (NYSE:PFE) TODAY ANNOUNCED ITS INVESTIGATIONAL CANCER IMMUNOTHERAPY, ELRANATAMAB, RECEIVED BREAKTHROUGH THERAPY DESIGNATION FROM THE U.S. FOOD AND DRUG ADMINISTRATION (FDA) FOR THE TREATMENT OF PEOPLE WITH RELAPSED OR REFRACTORY MULTIPLE MYELOMA (RRMM).'}